{"id":"467179","name":"灵芝孢子粉炖蛋汤","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/467179/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"灵芝孢子粉","amount":"6g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3个"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"30g"},{"name":"枸杞子","amount":"20g"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"少许"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"少许"},{"name":"水","amount":"800g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"孢子粉。","img":"images/467179/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"我用的是灰枣、枸杞子，用清水洗净。","img":"images/467179/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸡蛋3个。","img":"images/467179/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"取汤盅，倒入煮沸的开水。","img":"images/467179/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"打入鸡蛋。","img":"images/467179/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把灰枣、孢子粉、枸杞子一起倒入汤盅内。","img":"images/467179/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入电压力锅，汤内加点油和盐。","img":"images/467179/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"盖上盅盖，按煮饭键就可以。","img":"images/467179/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"时间到，炖好的汤，可以加点鸡精，不喜欢也可以不加。","img":"images/467179/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品，好喝的营养汤炖好了，是不是很简单。","img":"images/467179/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炖盅、电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}